    "Bid Summary": {
      "value": "This bid (BPM044557) is a Purchase Order Request for Proposals for Dell Laptops with Extended Warranty under a Hardware Master Contract for the Maryland State Treasurer's Office. The scope involves refreshing laptops to accommodate MD529 employees as of June 1, 2023. Questions were due by June 1, 2024 at 2:00 PM EDT to procurement officer Tamaira Hawkins. The solicitation is currently closed. Bidders must be authorized Dell resellers and comply with drug and alcohol-free workplace certifications per COMAR 21.11.08. Equipment must be new, unused, ENERGY STAR certified, and provided without restocking fees for returns due to damage or incorrect shipments.",
